OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear skies for most of the night,
OL,7,Fhowever cloud is expected to increase
OL,8,Ffrom the far south towards dawn.
OL,9,FChilly under the clearest skies
OL,10,Ffurther north. Southeasterly winds
OL,11,Fstrengthening overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA blustery day ahead with
OL,14,Fstrongest gusts around coasts. Best of
OL,15,Fthe sunshine first thing, then turning
OL,16,Fcloudier with spots of rain and
OL,17,Fdrizzle, mainly over the hills.
OL,18,FFeeling muggy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
